      defaultResponse: 'A common pattern may involve a state of high alert vigilance—the body and mind preparing to manage, correct, or intervene. Control may serve as a way of maintaining a sense of safety.',
      threatScan: 'The threat-scan may be calibrated to signs of chaos, unpredictability, or loss of order. Some people notice they detect small deviations that others don\'t feel and experience a somatic response—a tight chest, a drop in the gut, a surge of urgency.',
